    "Details": "The BattleMax BM-2 fights as a sniper, keeping distance with a large laser and AC/5, though the latter suffers from a persistent ammunition feed jam. Two medium lasers and a head mounted small pulse laser cover closer engagements. Six tons of standard armor offer only modest protection.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - AC</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.98</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
